		"content": "    In 2025, Republicans redrew Texas to pick up  \n    up five seats in the house of representatives. \n\n    By some twist of fate, Democrats have gained\n    control of the Texas Redistricting Commission\n    and can draw the districts to their liking!\n\n    Redistrict Texas so that 20 democrats win."
